<div id="Ax1.SSx6.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="Ax1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I2.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.1.</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I2.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Includes a conceptual outline and/or pseudocode description of AI methods introduced (yes/partial/no/NA) <span id="Ax1.I2.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.2.</span> 
