<p id="Ax1.I2.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Clearly delineates statements that are opinions, hypothesis, and speculation from objective facts and results (yes/no) <span id="Ax1.I2.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.3.</span> 
