<p id="Ax1.I2.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Provides well-marked pedagogical references for less-familiar readers to gain background necessary to replicate the paper (yes/no) <span id="Ax1.I2.ix3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
