<p id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All assumptions and restrictions are stated clearly and formally (yes/partial/no) <span id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
