<div id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All novel claims are stated formally (e.g., in theorem statements) (yes/partial/no) <span id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.4.</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Proofs of all novel claims are included (yes/partial/no) <span id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
