<div id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Proof sketches or intuitions are given for complex and/or novel results (yes/partial/no) <span id="Ax1.I3.ix1.I1.ix4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
